      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible heart attack do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order a troponin blood test, for chest pain. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's use aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for possible heart attack.",
